WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.859 --> 00:00:06.859
Welcome to ¡Fiesta Latina!

00:00:06.859 --> 00:00:07.859
Welcome to ¡Fiesta Latina!

00:00:07.859 --> 00:00:08.859
 

00:00:08.859 --> 00:00:09.859
 

00:00:09.859 --> 00:00:10.859
For 18 years, the Yale Peabody Museum and

00:00:10.859 --> 00:00:13.840
the Junta for Progressive Action have gotten
together to have this marvelous celebration

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:18.630
of Fiesta Latina!, which in 2020 we are
moving to a virtual world, together with the

00:00:18.630 --> 00:00:24.250
New Haven Free Public Library, the Yale Latino
Networking Group, and the Yale School for

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:28.800
the Environment.
Fiesta Latina! is a celebration of traditional

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:36.220
and contemporary cultures from Latin America,
and it is a wonderful opportunity to bring

00:00:36.220 --> 00:00:39.670
our voices here, whether you are a scientist,
an artist, a leader, whoever you are, all

00:00:39.670 --> 00:00:46.720
together during Latinx Heritage Month, to
work and learn to be able to have a more just

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:48.610
and sustainable future. 
We'd like to thank AVANGRID, our sponsor,

00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:55.220
for the opportunity to have a Fiesta Latina!
this year, and we want to invite all of you

00:00:55.220 --> 00:00:58.000
to participate in all the events we have organized.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:58.850
We look forward to seeing you!

